      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Read tier: client \u2192 CDN \u2192 LB \u2192 API \u2192 Redis \u2192 DB.  Write tier: same path, plus Counter alloc + Blocklist on create.  Side channels: Kafka for click events + DB CDC, three consumers downstream.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Read tier: client \u2192 CDN \u2192 LB \u2192 API \u2192 Redis \u2192 DB.  Write tier: same path, plus Counter alloc + Blocklist on create.  Side channels: Kafka for click events + DB CDC, three consumers downstream.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
