      "text": "Color legend  \u2014   Blue solid: sync redirect path  \u00b7  Pink: cache (Redis)  \u00b7  Indigo: durable storage (DB)  \u00b7  Orange dashed: async / fire-and-forget (clicks, CDC, consumers)  \u00b7  Yellow: stateful side-services",
